      "Custom Sheds, Metal Buildings, Garages, Saunas & Agricultural Structures in Massachusetts​​Residential, Commercial & Industrial Metal Buildings:",
      "Chateau Sheds designs and builds custom metal buildings ranging from residential carports and detached garages to large-scale workshops and industrial-style warehouse structures. Our steel buildings are engineered for heavy snow loads, wind resistance, and long-term durability in Northeast climates. Whether you need equipment storage, contractor workspace, commercial warehousing, or multi-bay garage facilities, we offer scalable solutions with customizable dimensions, roof systems, and layout configurations.",
      "Carports, Garages & Workshop Buildings",
      "Outdoor Wood-Fired & Indoor Infrared Saunas:",
      "We specialize in traditional outdoor wood fired saunas and modern indoor infrared sauna systems designed for residential and recreational properties. Our Finnish-style sauna models feature insulated wall systems, cedar interiors, real wood-burning stoves, and off-grid options for remote installations. Indoor infrared units provide energy-efficient heating solutions for home wellness spaces.",
      "Wood Burning Finnish Style Saunas",
      "Sheds, Double-Wide Buildings & Finished Cabins",
      "Our prebuilt and custom sheds are available in multiple sizes and styles including gable, lofted barn, and double-wide configurations. These structures are frequently converted into backyard workshops, man caves, she sheds, pool houses, storage buildings, or ADU-style living spaces. We also offer fully finished office sheds and insulated cabins with complete electrical packages for remote work, studio space, or guest accommodations.",
