      "We build durable animal shelters and farm structures including horse run-ins, goat and sheep shelters, custom chicken coops, greenhouses, and dog kennels ranging from single-unit enclosures to multi-kennel breeder facilities. Designed for year-round protection and ventilation, these buildings serve homesteads, farms, and rural properties throughout New England.",
