      "Old Hickory Double Wide Utility Buildings – Large Open-Span Structures Built for Expansion",
      "Chateau Sheds offers Old Hickory Double Wide Utility Buildings designed for customers who need more than a traditional shed footprint. Available in 20-foot and 24-foot widths and lengths up to 40 feet, these structures are delivered in two fully built sections and joined on-site to create one expansive interior space. Whether you are expanding storage capacity, building a multi-vehicle garage, creating a workshop, or planning a future livable conversion, double wide utility buildings provide a scalable solution without starting from scratch.",
      "Wide-Span Interior Design Without Interior Support Posts",
      "Double Wide Utility Buildings are engineered as two single-slope units with framed high-wall openings that align during installation. Once connected, the dividing wall is eliminated, creating a broad, uninterrupted interior layout.",
      "This design allows for flexible floor planning, vehicle storage, racking systems, workshop setups, or open recreational space without structural obstructions limiting your layout.",
      "A Practical Alternative to Site-Built Construction",
      "For many customers, a double wide building provides a faster and more cost-controlled alternative to traditional stick-built garages or additions. Delivered pre-constructed in two halves and assembled on a prepared pad, these structures reduce build timelines while still offering substantial square footage.",
      "• Equipment storage facilities",
      "• Large she sheds or man caves",
      "• Airbnb-ready shell structures",
      "The ability to customize door and window placement allows the structure to evolve with your needs.",
      "Structural Floor System & Pad Requirements",
      "Double wide buildings must be installed on a properly prepared, level gravel or concrete pad with continuous skid support. The reinforced floor system is designed to accommodate vehicle weight, equipment loads, and workshop activity when supported correctly.",
      "Because the building is delivered in two sections, proper foundation preparation ensures alignment, structural integrity, and long-term performance.",
      "Custom Garage Packages, Layout Options & Exterior Finishes",
      "Old Hickory Double Wide Buildings can be configured with:",
      "• Custom paint or urethane stain finishes",
      "• Secondary trim color options",
      "These customization options allow you to convert a large open shell into a garage, workspace, storage facility, or future build-out space.",
      "Clear Interior Layout for Garage & Workshop ApplicationsThe wide-span configuration supports multi-vehicle storage, tool organization, equipment housing, and customizable workspace arrangements without interior load-bearing interruptions.",
      "Two-Section Delivery & On-Site Integration SystemEach building is transported in two fully constructed halves and joined on-site. The framed high-wall openings align to create one continuous interior footprint, eliminating the limitations of standard single-unit sheds.",
